{"type":"message","id":"f0127f28","parentId":"0001dd8f","timestamp":"2026-03-29T04:19:48.552Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sun 2026-03-29 04:19 UTC] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/1). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: Create a backup script at `/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/github-backup.sh` that:\n1. cd to /home/node/.openclaw\n2. Check if workspace/.git exists, if so remove it with rm -rf workspace/.git\n3. Check if work/.git exists, if so remove it with rm -rf work/.git (ignore errors)\n4. git add .\n5. git commit -m \"backup $(date +%Y-%m-%d_%H:%M:%S)\"\n6. git push -u origin main (if fails, try master)\n7. Send a feishu notification via curl to the feishu webhook (check /app/extensions/feishu for webhook config or use a placeholder) with backup status\n\nMake the script executable.\nThen set up a cron job that runs every day at 00:00 UTC: /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/github-backup.sh >> /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/logs/backup.log 2>&1\n\nCreate the logs directory if it doesn't exist.\nReport back what you did."}],"timestamp":1774757988548}}
{"type":"message","id":"db9d19aa","parentId":"f0127f28","timestamp":"2026-03-29T04:19:57.532Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to:\n1. Check for Feishu webhook config\n2. Create the scripts directory\n3. Create the backup script\n4. Make it executable\n5. Create the logs directory\n6. Set up the cron job","thinkingSignature":"b3b463596389b391fb822e2bdf90b4a5493840155fdc37560e34681b0317c87c"},{"type":"text","text":"\n<tool_call>\n<exec>\n\n<description>\nCheck feishu webhook config</description>\n\n<command>\n\nfind /app/extensions/feishu -name \"*.json\" -o -name \"*.env\" -o -name \"*config*\" 2>/dev/null | head -20</command>\n\n<runFlags>\n\n</runFlags>\n\n<limit>\n\n</limit>\n\n<path>\n\n</path>\n\n<yieldMs>\n\n</yieldMs>\n\n</exec>\n<exec>\n\n<description>\nCreate scripts dir, logs dir, check workspace structure</description>\n\n<command>\n\nmkdir -p /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/logs && ls /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/</command>\n\n<runFlags>\n\n</runFlags>\n\n<limit>\n\n</limit>\n\n<path>\n\n</path>\n\n<yieldMs>\n\n</yieldMs>\n\n</exec>\n</tool_call>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":241,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":7397,"totalTokens":7638,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0.0002892,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.002773875,"total":0.0030630749999999997}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774757988552,"responseId":"0617db65ed65de371837198cf9101b7c"}}
